Text_en:
Summary of #Reza_Pahlavi in ​​#Munich;
Everyone is not with me; #Tajzih_Talib is #Islah_Talib or #Mujahid_Khalq.

This is the same referendum that is going to be held after the transition period;
J.A. or Pahlavi
Just like in 1358.

Despite the bombardment of foreign media and the propaganda of #Jaesh journalists, over 80% of the people support #Shahbacheh;
The Basijs themselves are aware of the lack of public support for Mirza Reza Diba and do not hide their concern about the lack of public support for the showman.
#Prince_Reza_Pahlavi
